# §19: profiles never share allocations or dispatch.
capacity red green
intents play
policy primary=preferential
context owner/shows
candidate o1 intent=play label="Owner 1" favourite=0
candidate o2 intent=play label="Owner 2" favourite=1
resolve
expect red=o1 green=o2
publish
press red
context family/shows
clear
candidate f1 intent=play label="Family 1" favourite=0
resolve now=1
expect red=f1 green=-
publish
release red expect=rejected:scope-inactive
